    "summary": "A projectile attack on Saudi Arabia's Jizan region injured two people and damaged a mosque and vehicles, according to Saudi civil defense.",
    "content": "At least two people were injured when a projectile, described as a missile or shell, struck the Al-Tuwal area of Jizan region in southern Saudi Arabia, the Saudi Civil Defense Authority said on Sunday. The attack also caused damage to a mosque and several vehicles, according to the authority. The injured were taken for treatment after the projectile hit the site.\n\nThe Houthi movement in Yemen was identified as responsible for launching the projectile. A spokesperson for the Saudi Civil Defense condemned the attack. Jizan, located near the border with Yemen, has been a frequent target of cross-border attacks since the conflict in Yemen escalated in 2015.\n\nThe Houthis have carried out numerous missile and drone strikes on Saudi territory in recent years, often targeting border regions such as Jizan, Najran, and Asir. These attacks have resulted in civilian casualties and property damage. The Saudi-led coalition has repeatedly accused the Houthis of violating international humanitarian law by targeting civilian infrastructure.\n\nFor the Somali diaspora, many of whom reside and work in Saudi Arabia, such attacks heighten concerns about safety and stability in the kingdom. Jizan and other southern regions host a significant number of Somali expatriates employed in various sectors. Any escalation in cross-border violence could disrupt livelihoods and potentially lead to travel or security advisories affecting diaspora members and their families.\n\nWhile the overall security situation in Saudi Arabia remains largely stable, periodic attacks near the Yemeni border serve as a reminder of the ongoing regional conflict. The Somali diaspora often relies on remittances and family ties to Saudi Arabia, making peace and security in the region of direct relevance to their well-being.\n\nRead the original report from Goobjoog here: https://goobjoog.com/2026/09/13/xuutiyiinta-oo-weerar-gantaallo-ah-ku-qaaday-gobolka-jizan-ee-sucuudiga/",
